{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15657","headline":"酬郑十四望驿不得同宿见赠因寄张参军 · 司空曙","name":"酬郑十四望驿不得同宿见赠因寄张参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逢君喜成泪，暂似故乡中。\n谪宦犹多惧，清宵不得终。\n月烟高有鹤，宿草净无虫。\n明日郄超会，应思下客同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}